# Conformance probe pack for ruling 21 of spec 0.21 in a `length ... bits`
# extent: a `rest` item that writes no bits at the end of the block, most
# significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   p           one presence bit, then 7 unused bits
#   block       an 8-bit length in bits: nums to its end; an item is val in 8
#               bits when p.1 is 1, and nothing when it is 0
format     conformance-extents-bits-zero
version    0.21.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
presence p 1
pad 7
length 8 bits
  group  probe.nums rest
    if p.1
      field  probe.val  8  uint
    end
  end
end
